    "work_en": "Indicated for Benign prostatic hyperplasia (BPH). Used in clinical management of specialised therapeutics.",
    "primary_indication_en": "Benign prostatic hyperplasia (BPH)",
    "indications_en": "Pumpkin is a plant. The seed and its oil are used to make medicine. Pumpkin is commonly used by mouth for symptoms of benign prostatic hyperplasia (BPH).",
    "dosage_en": "For benign prostatic hyperplasia (BPH): 5 grams pumpkin seed twice daily. 1-2 tablets or capsules of pumpkin seed oil or extracts daily. 160 mg pumpkin seed oil 1-3 times daily in combination with saw palmetto and other ingredients.",
