    "precautions_en": "Bleeding Events: Although most bleeding associated with the use of Bivalirudin in PCI/PTCA occurs at the site of arterial puncture, hemorrhage can occur at any site. An unexplained fall in blood pressure or hematocrit should lead to serious consideration of a hemorrhagic event and cessation of Bivalirudin administration. Bivalirudin should be used...",
