    "side_effects_en": "Nausea, vomiting, diarrhoea, erythematous maculo-papular rashes, sore mouth, black/hairy to ngue, rash, erythema multiforme, Stevens-Johnson syndrome, to xic epidermal necrolysis, angioedema, fever, joint pains, serum sickness-like symptoms, haemolytic anaemia, thrombocytopenia, leucopenia, neutropenia, coagulation disorders, prolonged bleeding tim...",
