    "dosage_en": "The optimal daily dose of Calcitriol capsule must be carefully determined for each patient on the basis of serum calcium level. In Post-menopausal Osteoporosis: The recommended dose of Calcitriol capsule is 0.25 mcg twice daily. In Renal Osteodystrophy (dialysis patients): The initial daily dose is 0.25 mcg of Calcitriol capsule. In patients with normal or only slightly reduced calcium levels, dos...",
