    "dosage_bn": "নির্দেশিত সেবনবিধি:\nOsteoarthritis: The recommended oral dose is 200 mg per day administered as a single dose or as 100 mg দিনে ২ বার. Rheumatoid arthritis: The recommended oral dose is 100 to 200 mg দিনে ২ বার. Familial adenomatous polyposis (FAP): Usual medical care for FAP patients should be continued while on Celecoxib. To reduce the ...",
