    "dosage_en": "Osteoarthritis: The recommended oral dose is 200 mg per day administered as a single dose or as 100 mg twice daily. Rheumatoid arthritis: The recommended oral dose is 100 to 200 mg twice daily. Familial adenomatous polyposis (FAP): Usual medical care for FAP patients should be continued while on Celecoxib. To reduce the number of adenomatous colorectal polyps in patients with FAP, the recommended...",
