    "indications_en": "Ceftazidime Injection is indicated for the treatment of patients with infections caused by susceptible strains of the designated organisms in the following diseases: Lower Respiratory Tract Infections, including pneumonia, caused by Pseudomonas aeruginosa and other Pseudomonas ... Read moreCeftazidime Injection is indicated for the treatment of patients with infections caused by susceptible strain...",
