    "precautions_en": "Use with caution in patients with hepatic or renal impairment. Consult physician during pregnancy.",
    "how_it_works_en": "23 herb formula to increase breast milk exerts its therapeutic effect by selectively interacting with specific physiological pathways.",
    "pregnancy_en": "Consult a doctor during pregnancy and lactation.",
