    "work_en": "Indicated for Vomiting. Used in clinical management of gastrointestinal & acidity.",
    "primary_indication_en": "Vomiting",
    "indications_en": "Cholera Saline contains different electrolytes which are usually depleted in various conditions e.g. diarrhoea, vomiting, profuse sweating etc. So, this saline is indicated in cholera, also in diarrhoea, vomiting, fluid loss, to replenish and restore the normal electrolyte balance of the body.",
    "dosage_en": "The volume and rate of infusion of Cholera Saline depends upon the requirements of the patient and the judgement of the physician. It usually varies with age, weight and clinical condition of the patient.",
