    "precautions_en": "Keep Polytar Scalp Shampoo away from children, in a cool place. Use eternally only and take care not to get any in the eyes. Avoid using this product if you are allergic to coal tar or any of the listed ingredients. It is not suitable for use by children below the age of 12, and never use on open, damaged, or blistered skin. In some cases, especial...",
    "how_it_works_en": "Polytar Scalp Shampoo is a thick, coal-tar based shampoo that soothes irritated skin on the scalp, reducing itchiness, scaling, and inflammation. These symptoms are often experienced by people with scalp psoriasis or other related skin conditions such as eczema. In these cases, a specially formulated shampoo is required, as standard shampoos often contain irritants that make the condition worse. C...",
    "pregnancy_en": "Animal reproduction studies have shown an adverse effect on the fetus and there are no adequate and well-controlled studies in humans, but potential benefits may warrant use of the drug in pregnant women despite potential risks",
