    "dosage_bn": "নির্দেশিত সেবনবিধি:\nFor Use in Chronic Spasticity: • প্রাপ্তবয়স্ক: The following gradual titration schedule is suggested. Some patients will not respond until higher দৈনিক dosage is achieved. Each dosage level should be maintained for seven days to determine the patient's response. If no further benefit is observed at the next higher dos...",
