    "dosage_en": "Mild to moderate hypertension: initially 90 mg or 120 mg twice daily (elderly once daily); up to 360 mg daily may be required (elderly upto 240 mg) daily. Angina: initially 90 mg or 120 mg twice daily in divided doses may be required (elderly up to 240 mg daily).",
