    "dosage_bn": "নির্দেশিত সেবনবিধি:\nTo reverse hypotension induced by spinal or epidural anaesthesia 3 to 6 mg (or at most 9 mg) Ephedrine Hydrochloride is given by slow intravenous ইনজেকশন: and repeated every 3 to 4 minutes as required; the maximum to tal dose is 30 mg. Ephedrine has also been given by intramuscular or subcutaneous ইনজেকশন:.",
