    "dosage_bn": "নির্দেশিত সেবনবিধি:\nUsual প্রাপ্তবয়স্ক: Dose for Cluster Headache: Oral, Sublingual: 2 mg ergotamine in fixed combination with caffeine given as quickly as possible after the first symptom of headache. Additional 1 mg doses can be given every 30 minutes until the headache has been aborted or until a to tal dose of 6 mg has been reached o...",
