    "work_en": "Indicated for Perennial or seasonal allergic rhinitis. Used in clinical management of respiratory & asthma.",
    "primary_indication_en": "Perennial or seasonal allergic rhinitis",
    "indications_en": "Fluticasone Furoate Nasal Spray is indicated for the treatment of the symptoms of seasonal and perennial allergic rhinitis in patients aged 2 years and older. Fluticasone Furoate inhalation powder is indicated for the once-daily maintenance treatment of asthma as prophylactic therapy in patients aged 5 years and older. This is not indicated for the relief of acute bronchospasm.",
