    "precautions_en": "Patients with prostatic hypertrophy or impairment of micturition have an increased risk of developing acute retention. A marked fall in blood pressure may be seen when ACE inhibitors are added to furosemide therapy. The to xic effects of nephrotoxic antibiotics may be increased by concomitant administration of potent diuretics such furosemide. Driv...",
