    "dosage_bn": "নির্দেশিত সেবনবিধি:\nAcute bacterial exacerbation of chronic bronchitis: 320 mg দিনে ১ বার 5 দিনের জন্য. Community-acquired pneumonia (Mild to moderate severity): • Due to known or suspected S. pneumoniae, H. influenzae, M. pneumoniae, or C. pneumoniae infection: One 320 mg ট্যাবলেট: দৈনিক 5 দিনের জন্য. • Due to known or suspected multi-dr...",
