    "precautions_bn": "বিশেষ সতর্কবার্তা ও নির্দেশনা:\n• লিভারের রোগে আক্রান্তদের ক্ষেত্রে অত্যন্ত সাবধানে ব্যবহার করতে হবে\n• গর্ভাবস্থা ও স্তন্যদানকালে চিকিৎসকের অনুমোদন ছাড়া সেবন সম্পূর্ণরূপে নিষিদ্ধ\n• ওষুধ গ্রহণের পর ঝিমুনি হতে পারে; গাড়ি চালানো বা ঝুঁকিপূর্ণ ভারী যন্ত্রপাতি পরিচালনা থেকে বিরত থাকুন",
    "pregnancy_bn": "ইউএস এফডিএ গর্ভাবস্থা ক্যাটাগরি 'C'। চিকিৎসকের সুনির্দিষ্ট নির্দেশনা অনুযায়ী সেব্য।",
    "work_en": "Indicated for Obstetric analgesia. Used in clinical management of specialised therapeutics.",
    "primary_indication_en": "Obstetric analgesia",
    "indications_en": "Isoflurane may be used for induction and maintenance of general anesthesia. Adequate data have not been developed to establish its application in obstetrical anesthesia.",
    "dosage_en": "Premedication: Premedication should be selected according to the need of the individual patient, taking into account that secretions are weakly stimulated by Isoflurane, and the heart rate tends to be increased. The use of anticholinergic drugs is a matter of choice. Inspired Concentration: The concentration of Isoflurane being delivered from a vaporizer during anesthesia should be known. This may...",
    "side_effects_en": "Nausea, Vomiting, Shivering, Dose-dependent hypotension, Arrhythmias, Malignant hyperthermia (rare), Elevations in white blood count, May decrease creatinine and increase BUN, Ileus, severe (fatal), Hepatic dysfunction (postoperative period),Respiratory depression may occur",
    "precautions_en": "Perioperative hyperkalaemia; raised intracranial pressure. May impair ability to drive or operate machinery. Pregnancy and lactation. Do not allow carbon dioxide absorbents in anaesthetic apparatus to dry out when delivering isoflurane to minimise the risk of developing elevated carboxyhaemoglobin levels.",
    "how_it_works_en": "Isoflurane may be used for induction and maintenance of general anesthesia. Adequate data have not been developed to establish its application in obstetrical anesthesia. Induction of and recovery from Isoflurane anesthesia are rapid. Isoflurane has a mild pungency, which limits the rate of induction, although excessive salivation or tracheobronchial secretions do not appear to be stimulated. Phary...",
    "pregnancy_en": "Pregnancy Category C. Isoflurane has been shown to have a possible anesthetic-related fetotoxic effect in mice when given in doses 6 times the human dose. There are no adequate and well-controlled studies in pregnant women. Isoflurane should be used...",
    "pregnancy_category": "C",
    "brands": "Flurane, Forane, Forane \\t \\t\\t\\t \\t \\t\\t, Forane \\t\\t\\t\\t\\t, Terrell"
