    "dosage_en": "Usual dose: 1 spoonful 1-3 times daily or as per doctor's advice. Adults and children over 12 years: 1 spoonful with water 2 times daily or as per doctor's advice. Children 6 to 12 years: 1/2 to 1 spoonful with water depending on age and size, in the morning and at bedtime or as per doctor's advice. Children below 6 years: Not recommended except as directed by the physician. An additional glass of...",
