    "side_effects_en": "Lamivudine: Pancreatitis, paresthesia, peripheral neuropathy, cough, dizziness, fatigue, gastrointestinal problems, headache, insomnia, anaemia, neutropenia, drug induced skin rash, hair loss. Zidovudine: Headache (which may be severe, has been reported in up to 63% of patients receiving Zidovudine and asthenia has been reported in 9-69%), malaise...",
