    "pregnancy_en": "Pregnancy Category C+B. If you become pregnant, contact your doctor. You will need to discuss the benefits and risks of using epinephrine/lidocaine iontophoretic patch while you are pregnant. Epinephrine/lidocaine iontophoretic patch is found in brea...",
