    "pregnancy_bn": "ইউএস এফডিএ গর্ভাবস্থা ক্যাটাগরি 'A'। চিকিৎসকের সুনির্দিষ্ট নির্দেশনা অনুযায়ী সেব্য।",
    "work_en": "Indicated for Hypothyroidism. Used in clinical management of endocrine & diabetes.",
    "primary_indication_en": "Hypothyroidism",
    "indications_en": "• As replacement therapy in hypothyroidism of any aetiology. Replacement therapy should not be instituted in transient hypothyroidism during the recovery phase of subacute Thyroiditis. • For the suppression of Thyroid Stimulating Hormone (TSH) levels in the presence of goitres, nodules and after radiological and/or surgical treatment of Thyroid cancer. ... Read more • As replacement therapy in hyp...",
