    "dosage_bn": "নির্দেশিত সেবনবিধি:\nMagnesium supplements must be taken with meal to reduce stomach upset and diarrhea. The recommended দৈনিক dose for প্রাপ্তবয়স্ক: and adolescents (12-17 years) is 1-2 ট্যাবলেট:s. Kidney failure: Should not be used in patients with severe kidney insufficiency. Liver failure: There are no data on patients with liver insu...",
