    "side_effects_en": "Lymecycline capsules may also cause the following side effects. Common (occur in less than 1 in 10 patients): • Feeling sick (nausea) • Abdominal pain • Diarrhoea • Headache Unknown (frequency cannot be estimated from available information): • Eyesight disturbances • Dizziness • Being sick (vomiting) • Yellowing of eyes or skin (jaundice) • Increas...",
