    "dosage_bn": "নির্দেশিত সেবনবিধি:\nThe immunizing dose is a single ইনজেকশন: of 0.5 ml administered subcutaneously. Primary Immunization For both প্রাপ্তবয়স্ক: and শিশু: from 2 years of age, vaccine is administered subcutaneously as a single 0.5 ml dose. Protective antibody levels may be achieved within 7 to 10 days after vaccination.",
