    "precautions_en": "Use with caution in patients with hepatic or renal impairment. Consult physician during pregnancy.",
    "how_it_works_en": "Menaquinone-7 is a fat soluble vitamin which is also known as vitamin K2. Menaquinone-7 is an especial key isomer of vitamin K2 that is produced using Bacillus subtilis. Menaquinone-7 is the active trans-isomer of natural vitamin K2 with the highest bioavailability and longest half-life in blood. This makes Menaquinone-7 also available for tissues outside the liver, namely bones, arteries and soft...",
    "pregnancy_en": "Menaquinone-7 can be used during pregnancy. Use of Menaquinone-7 during pregnancy may help both mother and child in formation and maintaining proper bone health.",
