    "dosage_en": "Adult: • 500 mg dose should be given to adults upto three times (1.5 gm to tal) per day with meals. The dosage may be reduced to 1 tablet (250 mg) three times daily. • In case of menorrhagia: 500 mg three times daily with meals and from the onset of menses and continued according to the judgement of the physician. Children: • 6 months to 1 year: 5 ml three times/day. • 2-4 years: 10 ml three times...",
