    "dosage_bn": "নির্দেশিত সেবনবিধি:\nOral- • Choriocarcinoma: 15-30 mg দৈনিক 5 দিনের জন্য, repeat after an interval of ≥1 wk for 3-5 courses. • Acute lymphoblastic leukaemia: Maintenance: 15 mg/m2 once or twice wkly, with other agents. • Burkitt's lymphoma: 10-25 mg দৈনিক for 4-8 days, repeated after 7-10 days. • Psoriasis: 10-25 mg wkly as a single dose,...",
