    "dosage_bn": "নির্দেশিত সেবনবিধি:\nIntravenous- Prophylaxis against urothelial to xicity: • প্রাপ্তবয়স্ক: Refer to individual and local protocol. Dose calculated according to cytotoxic dose. Normally given at a dose ≥cytotoxic dose. Duration of treatment should be as long as cytotoxic treatment; plus the time it takes for concentration of antineoplasti...",
