    "precautions_bn": "বিশেষ সতর্কবার্তা:\n• চিকিৎসকের পরামর্শ অনুযায়ী নিয়মিত সেবন করুন।\n• শিশুদের নাগালের বাইরে নিরাপদ স্থানে সংরক্ষণ করুন।",
    "pregnancy_bn": "গর্ভাবস্থায় ও স্তন্যদানকালে বিশেষ সতর্কতা অবলম্বন করুন। চিকিৎসকের পরামর্শ ব্যতীত সেবন নিষেধ।",
    "work_en": "Indicated for Vitamin deficiency. Used in clinical management of specialised therapeutics.",
    "primary_indication_en": "Vitamin deficiency",
    "indications_en": "Complete Multivitamin for Teen Boys to Support: Healthy muscle function with magnesium; Healthy immune system with vitamins C and E, beta-carotene, zinc, iron and selenium; Bone strength with calcium, vitamin D, and magnesium; Energy through the conversion of food to fuel with vitamins B6 and B12, thiamin, riboflavin, and niacin.",
    "dosage_en": "Teens: One tablet daily, with food.",
    "side_effects_en": "Allergic sensitization has been reported following oral administration of folic acid.",
    "precautions_en": "Folic acid alone is improper therapy in the treatment of pernicious anaemia and other megaloblastic anaemia where Vitamin B12 is deficient.",
    "how_it_works_en": "This preparation is a comprehensive multivitamin and mineral supplement designed to help teen boys to meet their increased nutritional needs.",
