    "pregnancy_en": "Pregnancy: Nefopam Hydrochloride is not recommended for pregnant women. Lactation: Evidence suggests that nefopam is excreted in human milk. A decision should made whether to discontinue nursing or discontinue the medication, taking into account the...",
