    "pregnancy_bn": "গর্ভাবস্থায় ও স্তন্যদানকালে বিশেষ সতর্কতা অবলম্বন করুন। চিকিৎসকের পরামর্শ ব্যতীত সেবন নিষেধ।",
    "work_en": "Indicated for Minor burns. Used in clinical management of analgesic & antipyretic.",
    "primary_indication_en": "Minor burns",
    "indications_en": "This is a first aid cream. It prevents infections and provides temporary relief of pain or discomfort in minor cuts, scrapes and burns.",
    "dosage_en": "Clean the affected area. Apply a small amount of product (an amount equal to the surface area of the tip of a finger). May be covered with a sterile bandage. Safety and effectiveness in children below 2 years of age have not been established.",
