    "dosage_bn": "নির্দেশিত সেবনবিধি:\nIntravenous (প্রাপ্তবয়স্ক:)- Adjuvant therapy in stage III colon cancer: In combination with fluorouracil/ leucovorin: 85 mg/m2 every 2 wk for 12 cycles. Dose to be given by IV infusion over 2-6 hr, dissolved in 250-500 ml of glucose 5%, every 2 wk; given for 12 cycles. After recovery from to xicity, reduce dose to 75...",
