    "side_effects_en": "Common side effects of Pazopanib include: • Hepatic Toxicity and Hepatic Impairment • QT Prolongation and Torsades de Pointes • Cardiac Dysfunction • Hemorrhagic Events • Arterial and Venous Thromboembolic Events • Thrombotic Microangiopathy • Gastrointestinal Perforation and Fistula • Interstitial Lung Disease/Pneumonitis • Reversible Posterior Le...",
