    "how_it_works_en": "The efficacy of Paroxetine is presumed to be linked to potentiation of serotonergic activity in the central nervous system resulting from inhibition of neuronal reuptake of serotonin (5-hydroxy-tryptamine, 5 HT). Studies at clinically relevant doses in humans have demonstrated that paroxetine blocks the uptake of serotonin into human platelets. In vitro studies in animals also suggest that paroxet...",
    "pregnancy_en": "This drug should be used during pregnancy only if the potential benefit justifies the potential risk to the fetus. Labor and Delivery: The effect of Paroxetine on labor and delivery in humans is unknown. Nursing Mothers: Like many other drugs, Paroxe...",
