    "dosage_bn": "নির্দেশিত সেবনবিধি:\nThe initial dose of this ক্যাপসুল: for CKD stage 3 and 4 patients is based on baseline intact parathyroid hormone (iPTH) levels. Baseline intact parathyroid hormone (iPTH) Level: <500 pg/ml • দৈনিক Dose: 1 mcg • দৈনিক Dose: 2 mcg Baseline intact parathyroid hormone (iPTH) Level: >500 pg/ml • দৈনিক Dose: 2 mcg • দৈনিক D...",
