    "indications_en": "Phenobarbital is indicated for the following conditions: • Sedatives • Hypnotics for the short-term treatment of insomnia • Pre-anesthetics • Long-term anticonvulsants for the treatment of generalized to nic-clonic and cortical local seizures. And, in the emergency control of certain acute convulsive episodes, (those associated with status epilepticus, eclampsia meningitis, tetanus, and to xic rea...",
