    "precautions_en": "Monitor CBC. Premedication with folate and vitamin B12 are recommended as prophylaxis against haematological and GI to xicity during treatment. Pre-treatment with a corticosteroid also reduces the incidence and severity of skin reactions. Caution when used in renal or hepatic impairment. Not recommended for use in pregnancy and lactation.",
