    "side_effects_en": "Along with its needed effects, a medicine may cause some unwanted effects. Although not all of these side effects may occur, if they do occur they may need medical attention. Check with your doctor as soon as possible if any of the following side effects occur: Skin irritation not present before use of salicylic acid and sulfur Some side effects ma...",
    "precautions_en": "When using salicylic acid and sulfur combination medicine, do not use any of the following preparations on the same affected area as salicylic acid and sulfur, unless otherwise directed by your doctor: • Abrasive soaps or cleansers • Alcohol-containing preparations • Any other to pical acne preparation or preparation containing a peeling agent (for...",
    "how_it_works_en": "Salicylic acid is a potent keratolytic with mild antiseptic action when applied to pically. Sulfur to pical is a scabicide and keratolytic agent. The mechanism of action when these two ingredients are combined, may be a synergistic keratolytic effect. The mechanism of action of salicylic acid in the treatment of acne may also include anti-inflammatory activity.",
