    "how_it_works_en": "Potassium Chloride is used for the treatment of hypokalaemia and of potassium deficiency states. Potassium ion is the principal intracellular cation of most body tissues. It participates in a number of essential physiological processes, including the maintenance of intracellular to nicity, the transmission of nerve impulses, the contraction of cardiac, skeletal and smooth muscle and the maintenanc...",
