    "precautions_en": "General: Drugs having anticholingeric properties should be used with caution in patients with narrow-angle glaucoma, prostatic hypertrophy, stenosing peptic ulcer, pyloroduodenal obstruction, and bladder-neck obstruction. Promethazine hydrochloride (promethazine hydrochloride injection) should be used cautiously in persons with cardiovascular disea...",
