    "dosage_bn": "নির্দেশিত সেবনবিধি:\nFor Treatment of Toxoplasmosis: The dosage of Pyrimethamine for the treatment of to xoplasmosis must be carefully adjusted so as to provide maximum therapeutic effect and a minimum of side effects. At the dosage required, there is a marked variation in the to lerance to the drug. Young patients may to lerate higher dos...",
