    "work_en": "Indicated for Worm infections. Used in clinical management of antibacterial & anti-infective.",
    "primary_indication_en": "Worm infections",
    "indications_en": "This medication is used to treat intestinal worm infections such as pinworm, roundworm, and hookworm. Pyrantel belongs to a class of drugs known as anthelmintics. It works by making the worms unable to move (paralyzed) so that the body can remove them naturally in the stool. ... Read moreThis medication is used to treat intestinal worm infections such as pinworm, roundworm, and hookworm. Pyrantel...",
