    "how_it_works_en": "Pseudoephedrine is both an α-and β-adrenergic receptor agonist. It causes vasoconstriction via direct stimulation of α-adrenergic receptors of the respiratory mucosa. It also directly stimulates β-adrenergic receptors causing bronchial relaxation, increased heart rate and contractility. Like ephedrine, pseudoephedrine releasing norepinephrine from its storage sites, an indirect effect. This is its...",
