    "dosage_bn": "নির্দেশিত সেবনবিধি:\nপ্রাপ্তবয়স্ক: The initial dose is 300 mg দৈনিক. In patients with severe hyperthyroidism, very large goiters, or both, the initial dose may be increased to 400 mg দৈনিক; an occasional patient will require 600 to 900 mg দৈনিক initially. The usual maintenance dose is 100 to 150 mg দৈনিক. Pediatric Patients: Propylthioura...",
