    "dosage_bn": "নির্দেশিত সেবনবিধি:\nপ্রাপ্তবয়স্ক: Induction of general anaesthesia: The dosage of Propofol should be titrated individually against the response of the patient. The ordinary initial dosage in প্রাপ্তবয়স্ক: is 40 mg (4 ml) by slow intravenous bolus ইনজেকশন: at intervals of 10 seconds until the clinical signs show the onset of anaesthesia....",
