    "side_effects_en": "Local: Propofol is normally well to lerated. Its most common undesirable effect is pain at the site of injection that can be reduced by mixing the preparation with lidocaine or by injecting it into one of the larger veins of the forearm or the intercubital fossa. Thrombosis and phlebitis are rare. General: Hypotension and transient apnea may occur...",
