    "dosage_bn": "নির্দেশিত সেবনবিধি:\nপ্রাপ্তবয়স্ক: One ক্যাপসুল: initially, regardless of the time of day. Then one ক্যাপসুল: দিনে ৩ বার preferably before the main meals. শিশু: (from 3 months of age): Racecadotril granules should be administered to gether with oral rehydration. The recommended dose is determined according to body weight: 1.5 mg/kg per ad...",
