    "precautions_en": "• Intravenous injection is prohibited. • The vaccine and anti-rabies immunoglobulin must not be administered with same syringe and in the same injection site. • Before use, please carefully check package, label, appearance and the validity period. • After reconstitution, the freeze-dried rabies vaccine should be administered as soon as possible. •...",
