    "side_effects_en": "Rifampicin: Reddish discolouration of body fluids, asymptomatic increase in liver enzymes, elevations of BUN & uric acid, hemolysis, hematuria, intestinal nephritis, renal insufficiency, Gl discomfort, CNS effects, hematological changes, skin rash, endocrine effects. Isoniazid: Disturbances of liver function, hepatitis, Gl disturbances, peripheral...",
