    "pregnancy_en": "Pregnancy: May cause fetal harm. Lactation: Breastfeeding not recommended. Females and Males of Reproductive Potential: Discontinue Semaglutide in women at least 2 months before a planned pregnancy due to the long washout period for semaglutide.",
