    "dosage_bn": "নির্দেশিত সেবনবিধি:\nপ্রাপ্তবয়স্ক: 6 to 9 Million International Units per 24 hours, in 2 divided doses. In severe infections, the দৈনিক dosage may be increased to 12 to 15 Million International Units per day. Gonorrhea: 12 to 13.5 Million International Units in a single dose. শিশু: The usual দৈনিক dosage is based on 150,000 l.U./kg body w...",
