    "dosage_bn": "নির্দেশিত সেবনবিধি:\nErectile Dysfunction: For most patients the recommended starting dose is 10 mg. The dose may be increased to 20 mg or decreased to 5 mg based on requirement. The maximum dosing frequency is দিনে ১ বার. Tadalafil is effective for পর্যন্ত 36 hours. Benign prostatic hyperplasia: The recommended dose is 5 mg taken at the s...",
