    "pregnancy_en": "Tibolone tablet is contraindicated during pregnancy. If pregnancy occurs during medication with this tablet, treatment should be withdrawn immediately. For this tablet no clinical data on exposed pregnancies are available. Tibolone tablet is contrain...",
