    "dosage_bn": "নির্দেশিত সেবনবিধি:\nক্যাপসুল: or ট্যাবলেট: Usual doses are 50 to 100 mg every four to six hours. For acute pain an initial dose of 100 mg is required. For chronic painful conditions an initial dose of 50 mg is recommended. Subsequent doses should be 50 to 100 mg administered 4-6 hourly. The dose level and frequency of dosing will depend o...",
