    "dosage_bn": "নির্দেশিত সেবনবিধি:\nEdema associated with heart failure: The recommended initial dose is Torsemide 10 mg or 20 mg দিনে ১ বার. If the diuretic response is inadequate, titrate upward by approximately doubling until the desired diuretic response is obtained. Edema associated with chronic renal failure: The recommended initial dose is Torsemi...",
