    "dosage_bn": "নির্দেশিত সেবনবিধি:\nUveitis: 1-2 ড্রপ: bid-qid or as required. Diagnostic purpose/Pre-operative purpose: Instill 1-2 ড্রপ: in the eye(s) 15-20 minutes before examination. If examination is not conducted within 20–30 minutes, an additional drop may be placed in the eye(s) to prolong the effect.",
