    "dosage_bn": "নির্দেশিত সেবনবিধি:\nA course of verteporfin therapy is a two-step process requiring administration of both drug and light. The first step is the intravenous infusion of Verteporfin. The second step is the activation of Verteporfin with light from a nonthermal diode laser. The physician should reevaluate the patient 3 months after treatmen...",
