    "dosage_bn": "নির্দেশিত সেবনবিধি:\nVerapamil ট্যাবলেট: • The dose of Verapamil should be individualized by titration and the drug should be administered with food. • For essential hypertension the initial dose should be given 180 mg in the morning. If adequate response is not obtained with 180 mg of Verapamil then the dose may be titrated by following m...",
