    "side_effects_en": "Reactions which may occur because of the solution or the technique of administration include febrile response, infection at the site of injection, venous thrombosis or phlebitis extending from the site of injection, extravasation and hypervolemia.\\n\\nToo rapid infusion of hypertonic solutions may cause local pain and venous irritation. Rate of admi...",
