    "pregnancy_en": "Animal reproduction studies have shown an adverse effect on the fetus and there are no adequate and well-controlled studies in humans, but potential benefits may warrant use of the drug in pregnant women despite potential risks",
    "pregnancy_category": "C",
    "brands": "Nutridex 50"
