    "work_en": "Indicated for Rheumatoid arthritis, Osteoarthritis, Ankylosing spondylitis, Renal colic, Mild to moderate pain, Tendonitis, Acute musculoskeletal disorders, Bursitis. Used in clinical management of analgesic & antipyretic.",
