    "dosage_bn": "নির্দেশিত সেবনবিধি:\nOral\\nMyasthenia gravis\\nAdult: 0.3-1.2 g দৈনিক in divided doses.\\n\\nChild: <6 yr: Initially, 30 mg, 6-12 yr: Initially, 60 mg. Dose may be gradually increased by 15-30 mg on a দৈনিক basis until a satisfactory response is observed.\\n\\nNeonatal myasthenia gravis\\nChild: 5-10 mg given every 4-6 hr.\\n\\nParalytic ileus and...",
