    "precautions_en": "Use only if there is a clear diagnosis of migraine; exclude other potentially serious neurological conditions. Monitor BP closely. May impair ability to drive or operate machinery. Pregnancy and lactation. Child. Moderate to severe hepatic impairment. Prior CV evaluation for patients with risk factors of coronary heart disease; admin of first dose...",
    "how_it_works_en": "Zolmitriptan is a selective agonist for serotonin (5HT1 receptors). It relieves migraine by selective constriction of intracranial blood vessels, neuropeptide release inhibition and decreased transmission in the trigeminal pain pathway.",
