    "dosage_bn": "নির্দেশিত সেবনবিধি:\nপ্রাপ্তবয়স্ক: IV Palliation of malignant neoplasms 12 mg/kg/day (max: 0.8-1g/day) for 3-4 days, if no toxicity occurs, may be followed after 1 day w/ 6 mg/kg on alternate days for another 3-4 doses. May repeat course 4-6 wk later or maintenance doses of 5-15 mg/kg (max: 1 g) may be given wkly. \\n\\nAs an infusion: 15 m...",
