    "precautions_en": "Hypertension; history of seizures; thrombocytosis; chronic liver failure; poor renal function; ischaemic vascular disease; malignant tumours. Increased risk of thrombotic events. Monitor BP during treatment. Regularly monitor platelet counts and serum-potassium concentration. Iron deficiency, infection or inflammatory disorders, haemolysis, or alum...",
