    "dosage_en": "Adult: Topical As cream containing fusidic acid 2% and betamethasone valerate 0.1%: Apply twice daily. Usual duration: Up to 2 wk/course.",
    "side_effects_en": "Prolonged intensive treatment may cause local atrophic changes in the skin e.g. striae, thining and dilatation of superficial blood vessels. Dryness, itching, irritation, hypopigmentation, burning sensation at the site of application or miliaria.",
