    "side_effects_en": "Diarrhoea, stomatitis, vomiting; haemolytic anaemia, vasculitis, pulmonary fibrosis, hepatic disorders, suppression of ovarian function in premenopausal women, temporary or permanent sterility in male patients. Allergic reactions.\\nPotentially Fatal: Bone marrow suppression. Secondary malignancy, cardiac arrest. Anaphylaxis.",
